#: ../../tools/enrichr_tools.rst:32 57aceebe88b443beafb93f564aac0b2c
msgid ""
"**Description**: Perform gene enrichment analysis using Enrichr to find "
"biological pathways, processes, and molecular functions associated with a"
" list of genes. Returns connectivity paths between genes and enrichment "
"terms."
msgstr "**描述**：使用Enrichr进行基因富集分析，以查找与基因列表相关的生物通路、过程和分子功能。返回基因与富集术语之间的连接路径。"

