msgstr "**参数：**"

#: ../../tools/enrichr_tools.rst:36 b61fa124217b4579a390439856ef8860
msgid ""
"``gene_list`` (array) (required) List of gene names or symbols to "
"analyze. At least 2 genes are required for path ranking analysis."
msgstr "``gene_list``（数组）（必填）要分析的基因名称或符号列表。路径排序分析至少需要包含2个基因。"

#: ../../tools/enrichr_tools.rst:39 78b742c545af48068fa22c72489d20ff
